1
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,239
This time,

2
00:01:18,239 --> 00:01:19,319
the book is divided into two volumes.

3
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:20,319
There are 3,000 copies in total.

4
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:21,879
They have been delivered to the warehouse.

5
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:24,840
Don't mind me.

6
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,200
Have a meal first.

7
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:28,480
The book is not going anywhere.

8
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:29,959
Leave me alone.

9
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:38,680
Why are you haunting me?

10
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,439
I...

11
00:01:40,359 --> 00:01:41,359
I didn't do anything.

12
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,120
Right, my dear?

13
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:50,959
You've made up?

14
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,840
No, no.

15
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:58,840
If I had known this,

16
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:01,280
I would have gone shopping with Qi.

17
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,400
Leave now if you want to.

18
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:03,680
I'm sick of you.

19
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,680
Princess,

20
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,919
Yikeba has indeed received a batch of silver ingots

21
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,039
from the Yun State.

22
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,120
They have been sent to the minting tribe.

23
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,479
Send someone over immediately.

24
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:23,840
Make sure to catch them with the evidence.

25
00:02:24,199 --> 00:02:24,759
Yes.

26
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,520
Can't the silver ingots from Yun State

27
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,759
be transported to Langyue?

28
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:29,759
Yes, it can.

29
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:31,759
But it must go through the customs,

30
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,199
informing of its origin and purpose.

31
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,879
This batch of silver

32
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,000
entered Langyue by bypassing patrols.

33
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:41,000
Mr. Su, pay more attention when escorting in the future.

34
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:43,680
I'll take my leave.

35
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,560
Is it from the Fuyun Escort Agency?

36
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:51,319
You know the answer.

37
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,400
Who else would dare to escort goods

38
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,000
to the Langyue?

39
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,719
It was Yikeba

40
00:02:57,719 --> 00:02:59,039
who killed his father.

41
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:01,680
My father and I never figured out why.

42
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,280
Now it seems

43
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,599
he has been secretly amassing Langyue's wealth,

44
00:03:06,639 --> 00:03:07,719
colluding with traitors from the Yun State

45
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,960
to plot something.

46
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,039
That's why he killed the general,

47
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:14,360
to make it easier for them to smuggle money.

48
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:16,520
So,

49
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,400
my mother died because of them too?

50
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:20,879
Over the years,

51
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,879
as long as it wasn't escorted by the Fuyun Escort Agency,

52
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:25,240
other escort teams would be robbed from time to time.

53
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,599
But this time we came smoothly,

54
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,919
and we weren't robbed.

55
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:31,800
Because they were robbed too.

56
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:38,319
What do you mean?

57
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,599
You want to use my book as a cover,

58
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:43,000
and the Su's Escort Agency as a start,

59
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:45,000
to promote trade between the two countries?

60
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:47,000
Not a cover.

61
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,080
Your book is just a microcosm.

62
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:52,120
Many things from Yun Country are also needed in Langyue.

63
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,919
Many products from Langyue are also scarce in Yun Country.

64
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:59,319
It has been controlled by that force for too long.

65
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:02,400
It's time for a change.

66
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,600
Do you think

67
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,399
the money that Fu Xiang gave to Lang Yue

68
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,680
could be from the Grand Preceptor?

69
00:04:31,839 --> 00:04:32,680
It's very possible.

70
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:33,680
Think about it,

71
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:35,600
in the entire Yunjing,

72
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:36,879
who else could afford

73
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:39,519
to spend so much money at once?

74
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:42,240
And according to them,

75
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,959
this has been going on for many years.

76
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,319
Is it dangerous for us

77
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,639
to face him directly?

78
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,120
What?

79
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,560
Are you afraid, Mr. Su?

80
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,839
Yes.

81
00:04:55,319 --> 00:04:56,000
What are you afraid of?

82
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,639
I'm just thinking

83
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,879
we need to hire more people.

84
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:05,800
We'd better think about

85
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:08,240
how to sleep tonight.

86
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,920
It's unreasonable to let a woman sleep on the ground.

87
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:24,040
If my father finds out,

88
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,920
he'll beat me to death.

89
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:29,240
You said the same thing on the first day.

90
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,959
You still remember?

91
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:35,160
Don't you remember, too?

92
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,560
Then let's stick to the old routine.

93
00:06:10,319 --> 00:06:11,560
So when can we

94
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,879
change this rule?

95
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,720
Go to sleep.

96
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,920
Go to sleep.

97
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,720
My lady, come on,

98
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,439
Have breakfast.

99
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:09,199
Why did you get up so early today?

100
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,240
Don't mention it.

101
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,759
I was dragged out by my brother in the morning.

102
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,319
Your brother

103
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,759
can't wait to give the whole city

104
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:18,399
to Tang Xin.

105
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,120
He's gone shopping again.

106
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,120
If I go shopping,

107
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:24,000
I just want to go with you.

108
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:26,040
So I brought you breakfast.

109
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,079
Come on, eat it while it's hot.

110
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:29,680
I haven't eaten either.

111
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:30,680
Give me some.

112
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,560
What do you want to eat?

113
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,319
I'll buy it for you.

114
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,319
No need.

115
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:40,279
After eating, I'll take Cheng Qi to the street

116
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,639
to let him feel the charm of Langyue.

117
00:07:43,279 --> 00:07:45,920
Then I can write some stories about Langyue in the book.

118
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,800
And write me in it.

119
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,480
I need to borrow your husband for a moment.

120
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,480
What's going on with you two?

121
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,040
I wanted to ask you yesterday,

122
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:22,439
have you become a general?

123
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:24,120
Not yet.

124
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,879
I've always wanted to kill Yikeba,

125
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:28,160
but Princess Youzhen thinks the timing isn't right.

126
00:08:29,399 --> 00:08:32,279
What about your marriage?

127
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:37,360
I entered the barracks as the emperor's son-in-law,

128
00:08:37,639 --> 00:08:39,200
so I have to go through the motions.

129
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:41,799
You don't like the princess?

130
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,159
She trusts me a lot

131
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,759
and helped me find

132
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:48,080
lost martial arts classics and military books.

133
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:51,000
I'm not talking about gratitude, but affection.

134
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,039
What are you talking about?

135
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:59,080
Look at our rouge.

136
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,080
How does it compare to yours?

137
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:09,879
Shopkeeper,

138
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:12,039
could you bring more rouge?

139
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:14,480
I'd like to see more.

140
00:09:19,639 --> 00:09:20,039
Princess,

141
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,919
what's this act all about?

142
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,840
What do you want to say?

143
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:25,840
Playing hard to get.

144
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:29,759
I find he is very stubborn,

145
00:09:29,759 --> 00:09:30,720
stupid,

146
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,639
and dumb.

147
00:09:32,039 --> 00:09:33,799
I'll see how long he can hold on.

148
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,519
What are you going to do?

149
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,600
Which one do you think suits me?

150
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,399
Your Highness

151
00:09:45,879 --> 00:09:47,080
is born pretty.

152
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:49,360
I think any rouge

153
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:51,440
would suit you.

154
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,039
Really?

155
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,240
Then I'll take them all.

156
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,000
Princess,

157
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,960
you've bought so many of my books.

158
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,720
How about I give you the rouge for free?

159
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,200
Shopkeeper,

160
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,559
I'll take one of each

161
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,120
rouge here.

162
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,919
and send them to the Moonlight Pavilion.

163
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:15,600
You want to buy rouge?

164
00:10:15,919 --> 00:10:16,919
You buy her some.

165
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,840
I don't need rouge.

166
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,159
Come on, let's go have some fun.

167
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,279
We are good at archery.

168
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,000
So we have the Qianjie Tree.

169
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,720
As long as you shoot the knots,

170
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,960
you can get a gift for your loved one.

171
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,600
What a good shot! Amazing!

172
00:11:14,679 --> 00:11:15,200
Yeah.

173
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,159
I didn't know

174
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,840
you're such a good archer.

175
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,360
I want that.

176
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,639
This is for you.

177
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:40,039
You have a good taste.

178
00:11:40,519 --> 00:11:42,320
This bag suits Cheng Qi very well.

179
00:11:42,519 --> 00:11:43,200
This gift

180
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,559
is so precious.

181
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:45,399
You...

182
00:11:45,639 --> 00:11:46,399
Yeah.

183
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,519
It's so precious.

184
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,600
I must

185
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:51,000
write you in the next novel.

186
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:54,480
I won't let you down.

187
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,720
Do you have a gift for me?

188
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:03,039
But I've never shot arrows.

189
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,600
You can try today.

190
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:08,679
OK.

191
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,320
I'm willing

192
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,080
to try for you today.

193
00:13:12,639 --> 00:13:13,320
Your Royal Highness,

194
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,840
could my wife take your place?

195
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,080
What are you doing?

196
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,279
I'm teaching him

197
00:13:37,679 --> 00:13:38,600
that the arrow

198
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,639
should be aligned with the target.

199
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,240
Good.

200
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:47,600
Give me the knot.

201
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:56,639
Since you gave a gift,

202
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,639
I should give one too.

203
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,000
The rules of Langyue state

204
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,000
that knots are not to be exchanged,

205
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:14,799
but given directly

206
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:15,799
to the one in your heart.

207
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,240
It seems my husband has someone else in mind.

208
00:14:18,639 --> 00:14:19,360
In that case,

209
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:20,720
let's just call off the engagement.

210
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,120
Princess,

211
00:14:39,159 --> 00:14:41,159
I'm not feeling well.

212
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:43,720
We can talk about the other things later.

213
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:01,240
My husband is not feeling well.

214
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,399
I need to check on him.

215
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,840
The act just now by Princess Youzhen

216
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:12,399
was to make Bai Yanli express his feelings.

217
00:15:12,639 --> 00:15:14,440
After all, they are about to get married.

218
00:15:14,639 --> 00:15:16,200
My lady, please don't mind.

219
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,279
I know.

220
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:20,080
I think Bai is sincere to Yigu.

221
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,039
I can tell.

222
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:25,440
My little wood finally got it.

223
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,639
You know what?

224
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,559
Pax looks handsome

225
00:15:29,559 --> 00:15:30,879
in Lang Yue's clothes.

226
00:15:32,399 --> 00:15:33,080
Not bad.

227
00:15:33,279 --> 00:15:34,600
When Pax gave me the knot,

228
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:35,919
I didn't dare to look at him.

229
00:15:35,919 --> 00:15:37,320
I felt my heart was in a mess.

230
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:39,679
When Princess gave me the wine bag,

231
00:15:39,679 --> 00:15:40,840
I didn't feel anything.

232
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:42,000
When Pax left,

233
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,799
he seemed to look at me.

234
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,279
So cute.

235
00:15:45,919 --> 00:15:46,559
Su Yuejiao,

236
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:47,960
I'm angry.

237
00:15:48,399 --> 00:15:49,879
You always call him by his name,

238
00:15:49,919 --> 00:15:51,639
but you never call me by mine.

239
00:15:52,639 --> 00:15:54,440
Are you jealous?

240
00:15:55,279 --> 00:15:55,960
I'm not.

241
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:59,200
Why is Bai such a good archer?

242
00:15:59,639 --> 00:16:00,840
I'm jealous.

243
00:16:02,799 --> 00:16:04,120
I'm really jealous.

244
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,120
You admit it.

245
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,320
Qi.

246
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,799
Good for you, my wife.

247
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,399
You've learned to manipulate me.

248
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,120
Learned and applied immediately.

249
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,519
You are influenced by those around you.

250
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:18,759
You are influenced by those around you.

251
00:16:19,399 --> 00:16:20,639
You're right.

252
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:21,639
Let's go.

253
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,720
Okay.

254
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:31,720
Come again next time.

255
00:16:35,799 --> 00:16:36,320
Take it.

256
00:16:40,919 --> 00:16:41,720
Take it.

257
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,600
I want that one.

258
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:52,960
Thank you.

259
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,879
This is rouge from Astana.

260
00:16:56,919 --> 00:16:59,279
It used to be tribute to the emperor.

261
00:16:59,799 --> 00:17:00,440
Really?

262
00:17:00,679 --> 00:17:02,000
I'll buy some for Xin.

263
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:03,799
I don't need rouge.

264
00:17:04,039 --> 00:17:04,720
Don't waste money.

265
00:17:05,839 --> 00:17:07,960
You can keep it as a souvenir of Astana.

266
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:10,640
What do I need a souvenir for?

267
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:12,319
People buy souvenirs after they've been there.

268
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,400
Don't use this excuse to buy things.

269
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,759
It's not easy to come here.

270
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:17,680
Are you happy?

271
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:19,960
Xin uses rouge.

272
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:26,680
When your books are sold in Astana,

273
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:27,920
I'll buy some there.

274
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:30,240
Otherwise, who knows if you're tricking me again?

275
00:17:30,599 --> 00:17:33,039
You said your books are a Ning'an specialty.

276
00:17:33,039 --> 00:17:34,680
I won't be fooled a second time.

277
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,640
I'll have to think carefully

278
00:17:38,079 --> 00:17:40,359
about my next novel.

279
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,240
I'll try to sell it in more places,

280
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:44,480
so that my specialty can be everywhere.

281
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,079
Come on.

282
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:02,000
I specially asked the kitchen to prepare

283
00:19:02,119 --> 00:19:03,839
the specialties of our Langyue.

284
00:19:04,799 --> 00:19:06,279
Thank you for your hospitality.

285
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,400
It's very kind of you.

286
